00:12:28.920 --> 00:12:31.830
But attacks of that level won't even scratch us!

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:32.660
Don't underestimate us.

00:12:32.970 --> 00:12:36.940
You guys are still standing... Not bad.

00:12:37.390 --> 00:12:40.000
I'll make sure you regret it later.

00:12:40.300 --> 00:12:41.410
Get ready for a beating.

00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:46.640
Also, get ready for you-know-what.

00:12:48.650 --> 00:12:50.430
We'll show them who's boss!

00:13:00.810 --> 00:13:04.760
We'll teach those idiots from class F a lesson they'll never forget.

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:07.540
Guys, the true battle begins now.

00:13:07.540 --> 00:13:08.100
Rep?

00:13:08.580 --> 00:13:10.630
We'll beat them with everything we have.

00:13:11.480 --> 00:13:13.250
Good luck, comrades.

00:13:14.570 --> 00:13:15.580
Summon!

00:13:18.470 --> 00:13:19.440
What's our plan?

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:22.180
The staircase is right behind their classroom.

00:13:22.180 --> 00:13:24.300
Our main forces will attack them from the front,

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:27.620
and our secondary forces will come
around the staircases and surround them.

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:32.710
Rush them!

00:13:34.970 --> 00:13:35.670
They're not here.

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:36.570
Where are they?

00:13:36.570 --> 00:13:37.100
Did they run away?

00:13:37.320 --> 00:13:39.390
Yo, we're here!

00:13:40.330 --> 00:13:41.050
They're over there!

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:44.260
You guys should exercise more often. Wouldn't want mold to start growing on you, would you?

00:13:44.260 --> 00:13:46.270
Damn, those bastards...

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:47.740
When did they...

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:50.190
Demolish them on the schoolyard!

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:51.960
They're coming, Akihisa.

00:13:51.960 --> 00:13:52.620
Okay.

00:13:57.220 --> 00:13:58.530
All right, let's go out.

00:13:59.910 --> 00:14:01.330
What the hell is this?

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:02.410
Dammit...

00:14:13.360 --> 00:14:14.740
Follow him!

00:14:15.630 --> 00:14:16.940
They can't run away-

00:14:18.820 --> 00:14:19.590
...from us.

00:14:19.990 --> 00:14:21.220
Welcome.

00:14:29.290 --> 00:14:30.970
Detention!

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:31.400
No!

00:14:31.400 --> 00:14:32.740
Those who were KIA must receive supplementary lessons!

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:35.200
Wow, class A...

00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:37.690
They even changed their shoes
before coming out. What polite kids.

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:40.600
The split enemy groups have joined back up.

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:43.920
If we all gang up on one person...

00:14:43.920 --> 00:14:47.150
Even class A doesn't stand a chance.

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:49.990
All right, it's time for the next phase, Akihisa.

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:50.460
Okay.

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:53.690
Retreat!

00:14:55.420 --> 00:14:56.270
You're not running away!

00:14:59.340 --> 00:15:00.970
Why did you take your pants off?

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:08.390
Now's our chance!

00:15:08.390 --> 00:15:10.730
Kill them all while they're distracted by the pants!

00:15:15.450 --> 00:15:17.910
I frickin' love your Being, Akihisa.

00:15:17.910 --> 00:15:19.770
No one can match him in terms of speed.

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:23.320
Oh, I have a request!

00:15:23.880 --> 00:15:25.320
What's the matter, Voyeur?

00:15:26.460 --> 00:15:27.320
Please...

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:29.720
Take off some bras this time!

00:15:29.980 --> 00:15:30.860
I knew you'd say that.

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:34.930
You guys aren't bad.

00:15:34.930 --> 00:15:36.330
Let me be your opponent this time.

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:39.040
All right, Voyeur... Leave it to me!

00:15:44.680 --> 00:15:46.840
What? What? What?

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:49.160
You're wasting your efforts.

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:51.810
I'm not wearing a bra today.

00:15:58.860 --> 00:16:00.420
I can still fight...

00:16:00.420 --> 00:16:04.820
It's finally time for us to settle things, Voyeur.

00:16:04.820 --> 00:16:06.770
Settle things...

00:16:06.770 --> 00:16:09.700
The kanji for that is 'female' and 'male'...

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:12.580
Voyeur!

00:16:13.420 --> 00:16:15.340
I-I'm fine.

00:16:15.340 --> 00:16:16.800
I'll defeat her with my own strength!

00:16:17.150 --> 00:16:20.020
Yoshii, I'll be your opponent.

00:16:20.390 --> 00:16:22.780
Kubo! All right, let's go!

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:25.890
Weak, Yoshii.

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:28.600
If you so desire...

00:16:29.890 --> 00:16:32.990
I will feel no shame no matter how I am dressed!

00:16:33.270 --> 00:16:38.910
Prepare yourself for a hard, throbbing impact!

00:16:39.250 --> 00:16:41.850
And your counterattack will be a love tap!

00:16:41.850 --> 00:16:46.230
Wait, Yoshii! Why can't we "settle things" too-

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:48.080
Now's our chance!

00:16:50.240 --> 00:16:51.190
No you won't!

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:54.080
That's enough.

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:57.280
Where's their rep, Sakamoto?

00:16:57.280 --> 00:16:59.810
Your opponent is us!

00:17:00.890 --> 00:17:03.220
We've taken out a lot of enemies already.

00:17:03.220 --> 00:17:03.910
Guys!

00:17:04.440 --> 00:17:05.380
Akihisa...

00:17:05.380 --> 00:17:05.990
Aki!

00:17:05.990 --> 00:17:07.140
All's going well.

00:17:07.470 --> 00:17:11.680
The surprise factor works well on these nerds.

00:17:11.680 --> 00:17:14.210
There you are.

00:17:14.210 --> 00:17:18.060
You guys sure have lots of tricks up your sleeves.

00:17:19.500 --> 00:17:20.750
Impressed, aren't ya?

00:17:21.010 --> 00:17:23.770
But this is the end.

00:17:24.030 --> 00:17:26.940
Yuuji, I'm going to defeat you.

00:17:27.220 --> 00:17:29.380
Don't take my line.

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:30.230
Let's do this!

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:31.320
Permission granted.

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:34.200
Summoning Being... Summon!

00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:38.470
Summon!

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:50.210
My attacks missed!?

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:52.200
We trained quite a bit.

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:55.950
With my Iron Bracelet, we can perform
summons without the permission of a teacher.

00:17:55.950 --> 00:17:59.440
And from that, we were able to learn how to control our Beings effectively.

00:17:59.890 --> 00:18:02.040
First off, you aren't experience in the art of controlling...

00:18:02.040 --> 00:18:06.020
And then you're exhausted from all the
mock-ESBs, sapping your concentration.

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:06.860
Dodging your attacks is a piece of cake!

00:18:07.090 --> 00:18:08.770
Don't give me that attitude!

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:10.490
One hit and you're done for!

00:18:10.490 --> 00:18:13.570
That doesn't matter as long as I don't get hit!

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:14.670
Take this!

00:18:15.680 --> 00:18:19.950
Our attacks might not do much damage, but they'll chip away at you eventually!

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:22.100
Why? They're in class F!

00:18:22.100 --> 00:18:23.910
We've been studying too.

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:26.510
We're still nowhere near your level, of course.

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:28.340
You're kidding...

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:30.300
There they are!

00:18:30.300 --> 00:18:31.150
Rep!

00:18:31.640 --> 00:18:33.340
They're all from class A!

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:35.230
Reinforcements got here faster than I thought...

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:36.050
Akihisa!

00:18:36.700 --> 00:18:37.480
Awaken!

00:18:45.300 --> 00:18:47.480
You're not passing through until we're done!

00:18:47.780 --> 00:18:48.960
Damn you!

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:50.030
Push!

00:18:56.150 --> 00:18:57.700
Your reinforcements are no help now.

00:18:58.080 --> 00:18:59.140
Don't worry.

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:00.930
I can handle you guys by myself.

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:02.490
You talk big!

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:03.090
Here I come!

00:19:03.510 --> 00:19:04.050
Yuuji...

00:19:05.970 --> 00:19:06.630
Prepare yourself!

00:19:06.630 --> 00:19:07.260
Bring it!

00:19:23.080 --> 00:19:24.390
How can they...

00:19:24.390 --> 00:19:24.950
Why?

00:19:24.950 --> 00:19:25.980
We're not talking about theory here.

00:19:26.270 --> 00:19:27.890
We're talking pragmatics!

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:31.870
Go!

00:19:31.870 --> 00:19:35.170
This is it!

00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:40.630
What's going on?

00:19:41.290 --> 00:19:42.070
My bracelet...

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:45.120
Dammit! Is it at its limit?

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:47.360
It was working fine when it was malfunctioning...

00:19:47.360 --> 00:19:48.090
Why is this happening?

00:19:48.090 --> 00:19:51.060
It hit its limit because you studied!

00:19:51.400 --> 00:19:52.180
What?

00:19:52.180 --> 00:19:56.540
That thing can only be used by an idiot!

00:20:08.050 --> 00:20:09.070
Kinoshita!

00:20:15.800 --> 00:20:15.810
Himeji!

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:16.450
Shouko!
Himeji!

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:24.500
Yuuji...

00:20:25.260 --> 00:20:26.180
Shouko...

00:20:30.820 --> 00:20:31.850
Akihisa...

00:20:32.150 --> 00:20:33.790
Himeji...

00:20:36.140 --> 00:20:37.860
Aki!

00:20:47.670 --> 00:20:48.920
What's going on!?

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:50.940
Akihisa!

00:20:50.940 --> 00:20:53.340
Are you okay, Yoshii?

00:21:08.140 --> 00:21:09.170
Thank god...

00:21:09.440 --> 00:21:11.160
I thought you were going...

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:14.670
I was so scared, Akihisa!

00:21:15.190 --> 00:21:18.680
I was really, really scared!

00:21:19.140 --> 00:21:20.740
Akihisa! Akihisa!

00:21:20.740 --> 00:21:22.780
I was scared to death too!
Akihisa! Akihisa!

00:21:22.780 --> 00:21:23.980
I was scared to death too!

00:21:27.830 --> 00:21:28.560
Thank you.

00:21:32.860 --> 00:21:34.390
That scared the shit out of me.

00:21:36.580 --> 00:21:40.990
Well, I only saved you because...

00:21:44.250 --> 00:21:46.660
Wh... Wha...

00:21:47.880 --> 00:21:48.540
Yeah!

00:21:52.860 --> 00:21:53.350
What?

00:21:55.410 --> 00:21:57.710
Class A wins.

00:21:58.900 --> 00:22:04.930
WHAT!?

00:22:09.450 --> 00:22:18.520
Baka, go go home!

00:22:18.810 --> 00:22:21.790
It's a time of peace now that school's out

00:22:21.790 --> 00:22:23.340
If I were to compare her

00:22:23.340 --> 00:22:24.880
"She's a real angel!"

00:22:24.880 --> 00:22:27.850
Then a sudden note ruined my fun

00:22:27.850 --> 00:22:29.240
It said I have a makeup test!

00:22:29.240 --> 00:22:30.630
It's hell!

00:22:30.960 --> 00:22:33.970
I was joking with my friends,

00:22:33.970 --> 00:22:37.000
"There's no way someone is that stupid!"

00:22:37.000 --> 00:22:40.080
But deep down inside,

00:22:40.080 --> 00:22:41.370
I was screaming,

00:22:41.370 --> 00:22:44.330
"That was me! I'm that stupid!"

00:22:44.750 --> 00:22:50.910
I thought the "Monthly" sign in the parking lot

00:22:50.910 --> 00:22:56.190
was the company's name!

00:22:56.190 --> 00:22:58.940
For the longest time...

00:22:59.640 --> 00:23:02.640
Stupidity is a manly character

00:23:02.640 --> 00:23:05.340
Is that our lack of common sense?

00:23:05.340 --> 00:23:08.650
Rules are useless in this world

00:23:08.650 --> 00:23:11.650
Eat Korean BBQ every night and overthrow the masses!

00:23:11.650 --> 00:23:13.290
Look!

00:23:13.290 --> 00:23:17.860
The sun that rose from the west is now setting down.

00:23:17.860 --> 00:23:20.900
Run! It's almost dinner time.

00:23:20.900 --> 00:23:27.770
Let's go home!

00:23:35.800 --> 00:23:39.200
Question 13: What's the name of
Fumizuki Academy's special system

00:23:39.200 --> 00:23:42.650
that uses testing as a means of war?

00:23:42.650 --> 00:23:43.630
Testing battles!

00:23:43.630 --> 00:23:45.880
Please remember what this show was about.

00:23:45.880 --> 00:23:47.820
Next episode: Idiots and Tests and Summoned Beings.

00:23:47.820 --> 00:23:49.820
This will be on your test.
